OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal after woman sexually
OL,4,Aassaulted on footpath
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are appealing for information
OL,7,Fafter a woman was physically and
OL,8,Fsexually assaulted while walking her
OL,9,Fdog.
OL,11,FThe incident happened on a footpath off
OL,12,FKearsley Lane in Conisbrough,
OL,13,FDoncaster, and was reported just before
OL,14,F15:40 GMT, according to South Yorkshire
OL,15,FPolice.
OL,17,FThe woman was taken to hospital and the
OL,18,Fforce said the suspect was a white man
OL,19,Fwho was wearing a blue fleece jacket
OL,20,Fwith a hood and a black scarf/snood
OL,21,Fcovering his face.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
